    "description": "PRONEXUS Inc., together with its subsidiaries, provides corporate disclosure and investor relation services in Japan. It offers disclosure support services, accounting consulting services, and IPO support services; investor relations support services, human resource recruitment and training support services, event video equipment and operational support services, etc.; sales promotion support services for financial products; and dashboard related services, such as corporate and financial information search databases, economic statistics databases, etc. The company also offers educational support, disclosure document translation, sustainability consulting services, inner branding support service, web-related services, and financial databases. The company serves listed companies, investment trusts, real estate investment trusts, and foreign companies. The company was formerly known as Asia Securities Printing Co., Ltd. and changed its name to PRONEXUS Inc. in October 2006. PRONEXUS Inc. was founded in 1930 and is headquartered in Minato, Japan."
